	(gr_text "TINKERROCKET ROCKET COMPUTER MINI - FABRICATION NOTES\nBOARD 22.55 x 69.62 mm, 8 LAYER, 1.630 mm STACK.\nF / In1 GND / In2 SIG / In3 +3V3 / In4 V_MCU_SWTCH /\nIn5 SIG / In6 GND / B.\n\n1. STACKUP: JLCPCB JLC08161H-2116, 1 oz OUTER / 0.5 oz\n   INNER. BUILD TO THIS TEMPLATE. OUTER PREPREG 2116 AT\n   0.1164 mm, CORES 0.300 mm, INNER PREPREG 1080 x2 AT\n   0.1528 mm, ALL Nan Ya NP-155F. SYMMETRIC BUILD.\n   JLC PUBLISH 4- AND 6-LAYER IMPEDANCE TEMPLATES ONLY -\n   CONFIRM THIS 8-LAYER BUILD BEFORE ORDERING.\n\n2. SURFACE FINISH: ENIG. REQUIRED FOR THE 0.5 mm PITCH\n   24-BALL WLCSP (U13, U33), THE 0.4 mm QFN-56 (U15,\n   U32), THE 0.4 mm X2QFN (U21) AND THE 0.4 mm 12-LEAD\n   (U1). DO NOT SUBSTITUTE HASL.\n\n3. VIAS: FILLED WITH NON-CONDUCTIVE EPOXY AND PLATED\n   OVER (CAPPED), IPC-4761 TYPE VII. VIA-IN-PAD IS\n   REQUIRED. ALL OTHER VIAS TENTED BOTH SIDES.\n\n4. CONTROLLED IMPEDANCE (OPTIONAL): 50 OHM SINGLE-ENDED\n   ON THE 900 MHz FEED (U16 TO J8), B.Cu REFERENCED TO\n   In6.Cu, 0.15 mm TRACK WITH 0.19 mm GAPS. THE RUN IS\n   UNDER 15 DEG ELECTRICAL - IF THE FAB CHARGES FOR\n   IMPEDANCE CONTROL, DROPPING IT IS ACCEPTABLE.\n\n5. MIN ANNULAR RING 0.05 mm.\n   MIN VIA 0.40 mm PAD ON 0.30 mm DRILL.\n\n6. MIN TRACK AND SPACING 0.09 mm.\n   HOLE TO HOLE 0.25 mm BETWEEN DIFFERENT NETS,\n   MEASURED HOLE EDGE TO HOLE EDGE - THE WALL OF\n   MATERIAL BETWEEN THE BARRELS, NOT CENTRE TO\n   CENTRE. ON THE 0.30 mm DRILLS USED THROUGHOUT\n   THIS IS 0.55 mm CENTRE TO CENTRE.\n\n7. MIXED TECHNOLOGY - ONE THROUGH-HOLE PART (C130,\n   RADIAL SUPERCAP MOUNTED LYING DOWN) SHARES THE BOARD\n   WITH 0.30 mm PITCH SMD. HAND SOLDER AFTER BOTH\n   REFLOW PASSES; SEE THE ASSEMBLY NOTES."
		(at 165.03 34.39 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "b1f0c4a2-7d3e-4a19-9c25-8e6a1f004201")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
				(thickness 0.18)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
